      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: Variable nodes are just examples.\nStill IndexOutOfRangeException can happens on latest SDK (VRCSDK3-WORLD-2020.08.06.17.38_Public).\nFor example, with UnityEngine.Object\n1. Equality node cause IndexOutOfRangeException.\n2. ToString node opens wrong URL https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/ScriptReference/Object.Object.html\n3. Get Name node opens fine URL (this is successful case) https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/ScriptReference/Object-name.html",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
