  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In Udon Graph GUI, clicking documentation link of a node causes IndexOutOfRangeException in some cases.\n\nIt seems cause when the node relates to C# class (I mean, not Unity class). For example, variable declaration of float, boolean operations.\n\nUDONSDK-2019.12.15.13.29_Public",
